Why Is Demand Increasing?
Expansion of digital advertising: Retailers, shopping malls, transport hubs, and other public venues are using digital advertising machines to deliver promotional messages and product information to high-traffic audiences.
Demand for measurable campaign performance: Real-time analytics and audience measurement help advertisers evaluate engagement, refine targeting, and make better use of advertising budgets.
Advances in connected technology: Cloud-based content management, QR codes, NFC, and programmatic buying enable more flexible campaign delivery and remote management of advertising displays.

Advertising Machine Watch: AI and Programmatic Advertising
Advertising machines are evolving from static promotional displays into connected systems that can deliver dynamic content and support data-driven campaign management. AI-enabled content selection and audience analytics can help operators adapt messages to locations and audience patterns. Integration with programmatic advertising platforms also creates opportunities to automate inventory sales and improve the utilization of digital displays.

